Z||000000||SN1PERVII||10-01-1999||12:36 AM||||    Hey all, I dont know much about engines and performance upgrades. I know my way around an engine to swap parts out but i could not tell you a thing about increasing the power. I want to build a a 2.8 for as little as posible. what is my best bet. increasing the displacement to 3.1, swaping in a cam, exaust? I would like to keep away from Nitro for the simple fact that i know less about this than any other mod except turbos. this car will be a daily driver. Also i was wondering can a fiero pul a small trailer. All I need to do is to pull my bike to a few rallys ever once in a blue moon.||||reg||1
Z||000001||lowCG||10-01-1999||01:00 AM||||I put a trailer hitch on my Mini Cooper to pull an RZ350 roadracer a few years back,should work on a Fiero.<BR>I would do the cheapest rebuild possible,with a 290DEG cam,flowmaster muffler,boosted fuel pressure;someone else here did use a cam like this with success.||||reg||6
