Z||000005||batboy||10-02-1999||11:00 AM||||Sniper, stroking the 2.8 to a 3.1 (3.2 bored out), using the GM hipo cam, adding an Accel coil, headers or manifold mods, and a free flowing exhaust should give you over 200 horsepower. This is a good, reliable, proven route to performance for the 2.8 V6.||||reg||1
